      "got_text": "If Apple cut its orders by 20% in fiscal year 2024, the dollar impact on Skyworks Solutions would be approximately $83,560,000. This is based on Skyworks' revenue of $4,178,000,000 and the percentage of revenue coming from Apple being 10%. The calculations use the formula: \n\n\\[\n\\text{Impact} = \\text{Skyworks Revenue} \\times \\text{Apple Revenue Percentage} \\times \\text{Order Cut}\n\\]\n\nWhere:\n- Skyworks Revenue = $4,178,000,000 (SEC 10-K accession 0000004127-24-000131)\n- Apple Revenue Percentage = 10% (disclosed as a floor; SEC 10-K accession 0000004127-24-000131)\n- Order Cut = 20% (0.2).",
